1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:01,738
Welcome!

2
00:00:01,688 --> 00:00:03,683
This is Maya.

3
00:00:03,683 --> 00:00:08,989
She is at home, on the ground, playing a game on her tablet.

4
00:00:08,989 --> 00:00:10,651
But wait.

5
00:00:10,651 --> 00:00:12,912
Where does the game live?

6
00:00:12,912 --> 00:00:15,106
Not in the tablet.

7
00:00:15,106 --> 00:00:16,662
Look up!

8
00:00:16,662 --> 00:00:19,747
We fly through the real clouds.

9
00:00:19,747 --> 00:00:22,884
A town is floating in the sky.

10
00:00:22,884 --> 00:00:25,000
Cream houses.

11
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:26,981
Teal lamps.

12
00:00:26,981 --> 00:00:29,614
The cloud is not weather.

13
00:00:29,614 --> 00:00:36,462
It is a town of helpers, high in the sky, that keeps your stuff and runs your games.

14
00:00:36,462 --> 00:00:39,162
That chest keeps things.

15
00:00:39,162 --> 00:00:42,021
That computer runs things.

16
00:00:42,021 --> 00:00:45,811
That little spark pops in for one job.

17
00:00:45,811 --> 00:00:48,031
Maya taps play.

18
00:00:48,031 --> 00:00:53,696
A tiny light flies from her tablet, up to the town, and back.

19
00:00:53,696 --> 00:00:55,864
The game loads!

20
00:00:55,864 --> 00:00:59,667
The cloud is a town of helpers in the sky.

21
00:00:59,667 --> 00:01:02,167
Now you know the cloud!

22
00:01:02,167 --> 00:01:06,861
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

